# Completing a task in the outline pane lists it under Today in the Logbook shown in the other pane.
file <<END
- Water plants
- Pay rent
END
keys gL <C-w> s
see │  󱓳 Logbook
keys g1 gh j x
see │  Today ·
see │  ✔ Pay rent
hide │  ✔ Water plants
quit
saved <<END
- Water plants
- Pay rent @done({today})
END
